const routeNames={seniors:'Seniors and disability support',community:'Local posts and community connections',accessibility:'Ramps and home accessibility',priority:'Useful starting points',all:'All resources',benefits:'Help paying for care',survivors:'Surviving spouse support',care:'VA care and caregivers',rights:'Care concerns and rights',local:'Home and community support',housing:'Housing and service records'};
const regionalIDs=role=>DATA.filter(x=>x.regional_role===role).map(x=>x.program_id);
priority.push(...regionalIDs('aging_agency').filter(id=>!priority.includes(id)));
routes.local.push(...regionalIDs('aging_agency').filter(id=>!routes.local.includes(id)));
routes.rights.push(...regionalIDs('ombudsman').filter(id=>!routes.rights.includes(id)));
routes.claims=['va-disability-compensation','r02-disability-increase','va-supplemental-claims','va-accredited-help'];routeNames.claims='Disability pay and claims';routes.health=['r02-va-health-enrollment','va-pact-act','va-women-veterans-call-center','va-location-finder'];routeNames.health='VA health care and toxic exposure';routes.education=['va-gi-bill','va-vre'];routeNames.education='School and the GI Bill';routes.jobs=['dol-american-job-centers','va-vre'];routeNames.jobs='Jobs and training';routes.records=['nara-discharge-records','va-veteran-id-cards','va-discharge-upgrade','va-accredited-help'];routeNames.records='Records, ID cards and discharge upgrades';routes.newvet=['va-solid-start','r02-va-health-enrollment','va-disability-compensation','va-gi-bill','dol-american-job-centers','va-home-loans','va-vet-centers'];routeNames.newvet='Just left the service';
